{
  "name": "Agent Orders",
  "description": "One row per order that arrived through an AI shopping agent, with the price the agent paid and the price listed at that moment.",
  "position": 0,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "import-orders",
      "label": {
        "en": "Import this week's agent orders",
        "zh-CN": "导入本周的智能体订单"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-agent-orders` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then import the agent-channel orders from the export or store I name, one row per order line, with the price paid and the price listed at order time. Upsert by order number.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先读这个文件夹里的 `busa-agent-orders` 技能并按它的流程做，然后从我指定的导出文件或店铺导入智能体渠道订单：每个订单行一条，写明实际成交价和下单时的标价；按订单号去重更新。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "orders-by-agent",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which agents bring us orders?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些智能体在给我们带订单？"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-agent-orders` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then summarise orders and revenue by agent channel for the period I name, and compare with the period before.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先读这个文件夹里的 `busa-agent-orders` 技能并按它的流程做，然后按智能体渠道汇总我指定时间段的订单数和收入，并和上一个时间段对比。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    },
    {
      "key": "paid-below-listed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Find orders paid below the listed price",
        "zh-CN": "找出成交价低于标价的订单"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-agent-orders` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then list orders where the unit price paid is below the price listed at order time or below the SKU's floor, and open an exception for each one that has none yet.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先读这个文件夹里的 `busa-agent-orders` 技能并按它的流程做，然后列出成交单价低于下单时标价、或低于该 SKU 最低价的订单；还没有异常记录的，逐条开一条异常。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    }
  ],
